---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const metadata = { title: 'Terms of Use — Taiwanese Gods', ignoreTitleTemplate: true };
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4 tracking-wide">
        Terms of Use
      </h1>
      <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-gold-300 mx-auto mb-6"></div>
      <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm">Last updated: February 2025</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">1. General</h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to Taiwanese Gods. By using this website, you agree to comply with the following terms and all
          applicable laws. If you do not agree to these terms, please discontinue use of this website. These terms apply
          to all visitors, users, and content contributors.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">2. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">When using this website, you agree not to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          <li>Scrape, copy, or download website content through unauthorized automated means</li>
          <li>Attack, hack, or attempt to disrupt website operations</li>
          <li>Post illegal, defamatory, or harassing content</li>
          <li>Impersonate others or misrepresent your identity</li>
          <li>Engage in any activity that violates applicable laws</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          All content on this website (including but not limited to text, images, design, layout, and code) is owned by
          the website or original authors unless otherwise stated, and is protected by copyright law.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-3">You may reference or share our content under the following conditions:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          <li>
            <strong>Non-commercial use</strong> — You may quote portions of our content with proper attribution and a link
            to our website
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Commercial use</strong> — Written authorization must be obtained in advance; please contact us
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Full reproduction</strong> — Unauthorized full-text reproduction or site mirroring is prohibited
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">4. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">While we strive to provide accurate and up-to-date information, we are not responsible for:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-3">
          <li>Any incompleteness, inaccuracy, or timeliness issues with our content</li>
          <li>Any direct or indirect losses resulting from the use of information on this website</li>
          <li>Content or security of external linked websites</li>
          <li>Changes to temple hours, addresses, or other practical information</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          The moon blocks, fortune sticks, and other interactive features on this website are provided for entertainment
          and cultural experience only. They do not constitute religious guidance or life advice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">5. External Links</h2>
        <p>
          This website may contain links to third-party websites (such as temple websites and Google Maps). These links
          are provided for your convenience only and do not constitute an endorsement or guarantee of their content.
          When using external links, please refer to those websites' terms of use and privacy policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">6. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Updated terms will be posted on this page. Continued
          use of this website constitutes acceptance of the modified terms. We recommend reviewing this page
          periodically.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">7. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about these terms, please email us at <a
            href="mailto:taiwanese.gods@gmail.com"
            class="text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 hover:underline">taiwanese.gods@gmail.com</a
          >.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a
        href="/en"
        class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-lg transition-colors font-medium"
      >
        Back to Home
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
